    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "ので introduces the cause in an explanatory way; から usually sounds more direct.",
     "texto": [
      "The cause comes before ので: 雨なので帰ります. With a -na adjective or a noun, な is used: しずかなので. The register depends on the whole sentence.",
